  "slug": "kava-lounge-west-palm-beach-groups",
  "title": "A Kava Lounge for Your West Palm Beach Group Chat",
  "seoTitle": "Kava Lounge in West Palm Beach for Meeting Friends",
  "metaDescription": "Make the group hangout easier: choose a kava lounge, agree on a time, compare drink options, and check events at Tribal Kava Lounge in West Palm Beach.",
  "dek": "One friend wants an activity. One wants to talk. One has replied \u201cdown\u201d to absolutely nothing specific. Here is an actual plan.",
